                                "sense_id": "06a714e6-cd69-3595-bca4-a828d62932c8",
                                "text": "The government wants to subsidise healthcare products for the elderly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c3dadba-b1f1-4415-8b4f-ba1b5b66c8f9",
                                "sense_id": "06a714e6-cd69-3595-bca4-a828d62932c8",
                                "text": "The Select Committee's recommendation that those which the railways are required to provide on grounds of national interest or social needs should be subsidised by the state has obviously been pigeon-holed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2fdae17-649a-4ccf-98ed-ae9af259037d",
                                "sense_id": "06a714e6-cd69-3595-bca4-a828d62932c8",
                                "text": "Money was tight in 1970, but the government was prepared to subsidise some loss-making passenger services because of their social benefits."
                            }
